    "image_with_text_jFC67D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_mckbY9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Set the Mood with Unscented  Pillar Candles",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_i6tgzQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco's pillar candles offer unmatched versatility in usage. Whether creating a soothing environment for a<strong> spa day at home, adding sophistication to corporate events or making celebrations more festive, </strong>these candles are up to the task. They’re perfect for adding a comforting glow to your daily routines or elevating the ambiance of special occasions. Upgrade your ambiance and consider a <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/multi-wick-pillar-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">multi-wick pillar candle</span></a>. Their gentle light and stylish presence effortlessly <strong>create a welcoming and warm atmosphere in any setting.</strong></p><p>Pillar candles can instantly transform your room with: </p><ul><li><strong>Visual Elegance:</strong> The tall and solid structure of pillar candles adds an aesthetic element to your design scheme, enhancing the visual appeal of a room.</li><li><strong>Soft Lighting: </strong>The gentle light emitted from pillar candles creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, ideal for relaxing or intimate gatherings.</li><li><strong>Longer Burn Time:</strong> Compared to other types of candles, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bolsius-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bolsius pillar candles</span></a> generally have a longer burn time, ensuring a lasting ambiance for extended periods, making them ideal for events or prolonged relaxation sessions.</li><li><strong>Versatility in Decoration: </strong>Pillar candles can be used in various colors and sizes in diverse décorative themes, from minimalist to ornate settings.</li></ul><p><strong>Better and Brighter Burn:</strong> Our Bolsius pillar candles are made exclusively with dripless wax and are guaranteed to make your candle burn brighter and longer.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_mckbY9",
        "border_i6tgzQ",
        "text_hUYJ6B"
      ],
