        "text_BNfhHV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Unscented pillar candles are more than just an accent; they're a design statement. <strong>Each Bolsius candle is made with dripless and smokeless wax. This ensures your candle burns cleanly </strong>and evenly for a long-lasting and consistent glow. The artisans meticulously craft each candle to be both durable and appealing. Kisco’s commitment to excellence sets these pillar candle collections apart, making them a welcomed addition to any occasion.</p>",
