          "settings": {
            "title": "Unscented Pillar Candles FAQs: Read More About Our Collection",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Discover more about the enchanting world of Kisco's pillar candles , from candle selection to care.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_6THxWy": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What Sizes Are Available in the Pillar Candles Collection?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>These pillar candle collections include various sizes to fit your needs, from petite <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles/products/bolsius-2-x-4-decorative-pillar-candles-unscented-wedding-pillar-candles-set-of-20?variant=40196407132269\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">2\"x4\" pillar candles </span></a>perfect for intimate settings to larger <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles/products/bolsius-3-x-3-unscented-wedding-pillar-candles-smooth-even-burning-candles-set-of-6?variant=40196407984237\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">3\"x3\" pillar candle </span></a>options for a more pronounced presence. <strong>Each size is crafted to the same high standards of quality and elegance.</strong></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_ykeVbb": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What types of wedding candles do you offer in this collection?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer elegant wedding candles in the styles couples use most often, including taper candles, pillar candles, and floating candles. This makes it easier to build a coordinated candle plan for the ceremony, cocktail hour, and reception tables.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_68L9WH": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Which candle style works best for wedding centerpieces?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The best style depends on the centerpiece design. Pillar candles are a strong fit for fuller arrangements and statement tables, taper candles suit formal dining layouts, and floating candles work beautifully in bowls and glass vases for a softer, reflective look.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zbiA3h": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_YnWqLz": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I choose between white and ivory wedding candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_HcQMNY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose white when you want a crisp, clean look, and choose ivory when your décor leans warmer with cream florals, champagne tones, or softer neutrals. Staying within one color family usually creates the most polished result across the full event.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_7QXgMW": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_9WEyKD": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do your wedding candles come in several sizes?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dVX3fF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. We offer wedding candles in a wide size range so you can match the candle to the setup. Tapers are available in taller event-friendly heights, floating candles work in multiple centerpiece sizes, and pillar candles can be used as stand-alone décor or grouped displays.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_yWfwzA": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_ta7idi": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How long do your wedding candles burn?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_3NdhUz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Burn time depends on the candle style and size you choose. Tapers are a practical choice for ceremony and dinner service, floating candles work well for several hours of centerpiece use, and larger pillars are the best fit when you need candlelight to last deeper into the event.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_a7abgi": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_g6fNEM": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are your wedding candles unscented?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_BAHPzG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Many couples prefer unscented <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/elegant-wedding-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">wedding candles</span></a> because they create ambiance without competing with florals, food, or the feel of the room. They are especially useful for receptions, formal dining setups, and indoor venues.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_NCEhef": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_MFgK38": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What wedding candles are best for ceremony décor?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_i98zBE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Taper candles</span></a> are a classic option for ceremony styling because they add height and elegance without taking up much space. <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Pillar candles</span></a> are also a strong choice for aisles, altar areas, and entry displays where you want more visual presence.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_eBPT9L": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_fWAaNH": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What wedding candles are best for reception tables?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_MqXff9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pillars, tapers, and floating candles can all work well on reception tables, but the best choice depends on the floral design, vessel style, and table size. Couples often use tapers for a refined formal look, pillars for fuller candle groupings, and floating candles when the décor includes glass and water elements.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_gF8Et8": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_qtBKmU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I estimate how many wedding candles I need?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_r9jBGP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Start with the number of guest tables, then count any extra candle moments such as ceremony décor, welcome tables, bar displays, gift tables, and lounge areas. It also helps to add a small buffer so setup stays smooth if the layout changes.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_nWeUNk": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_bn8N6W": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why choose Kisco Candles for elegant wedding candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_LbjV4X": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer the classic candle styles that wedding buyers come back to again and again, with practical size and color options that work across many décor directions. That makes it easier to build a wedding candle order that feels cohesive from start to finish.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
